{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_018KNibevTbcrgHjYeHjrzAN", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/10/18/anthropic-ai-public-benefit-fund.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://aimagazine.com/news/anthropic-to-invest-5-of-shares-to-its-public-benefit-fund\"}, {\"url\": \"https://mixed-news.com/en/anthropic-public-benefit-fund-5-percent-equity-stockholder-approval/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.unite.ai/anthropic-commits-5-of-its-shares-to-new-public-benefit-fund/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.anthropic.com/news/public-benefit-fund\"}, {\"url\": \"https://finance.yahoo.com/technology/ai/articles/anthropic-commit-5-stake-public-191115841.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.aninews.in/news/business/anthropic-to-allocate-5-stake-to-public-benefit-fund-stake-may-rise-with-valuation-growth20261019153835/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.breitbart.com/tech/2026/10/19/anthropic-will-dedicate-5-of-shares-to-public-benefit-fund-ahead-of-landmark-ai-ipo/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://finance.biggo.com/news/fbd11dc3-721f-4eb4-bdcb-0e9f45c59816\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T13:17:57.039Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "Anthropic Public Benefit Fund announcement percentage of shares stockholder approval", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_01TybsfNDE2Xh4RzwtyaKt96", "content": [{"title": "Anthropic commits 5% of shares to new public benefit fund that could address AI job disruption", "url": "https://www.cnbc.com/2026/10/18/anthropic-ai-public-benefit-fund.html"}, {"title": "Anthropic To Invest 5% of Shares to Its Public Benefit Fund", "url": "https://aimagazine.com/news/anthropic-to-invest-5-of-shares-to-its-public-benefit-fund"}, {"title": "Anthropic needs stockholder approval to commit 5% of itself to a public benefit fund", "url": "https://mixed-news.com/en/anthropic-public-benefit-fund-5-percent-equity-stockholder-approval/"}, {"title": "Anthropic Commits 5% of Its Shares to New Public Benefit Fund", "url": "https://www.unite.ai/anthropic-commits-5-of-its-shares-to-new-public-benefit-fund/"}, {"title": "Investing in the public benefit \\ Anthropic", "url": "https://www.anthropic.com/news/public-benefit-fund"}, {"title": "Anthropic to commit 5% stake to new public benefit fund", "url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/technology/ai/articles/anthropic-commit-5-stake-public-191115841.html"}, {"title": "Anthropic to allocate 5% stake to public benefit fund, stake may rise with valuation growth", "url": "https://www.aninews.in/news/business/anthropic-to-allocate-5-stake-to-public-benefit-fund-stake-may-rise-with-valuation-growth20261019153835/"}, {"title": "Anthropic Will Dedicate 5% of Shares to 'Public Benefit Fund' After Landmark AI IPO", "url": "https://www.breitbart.com/tech/2026/10/19/anthropic-will-dedicate-5-of-shares-to-public-benefit-fund-ahead-of-landmark-ai-ipo/"}, {"title": "Anthropic to Place 5% of Its Stock in a New Public Benefit Fund, Subject to Shareholder Approval — BigGo Finance", "url": "https://finance.biggo.com/news/fbd11dc3-721f-4eb4-bdcb-0e9f45c59816"}]}, "Anthropic announced on October 18, 2026 that it plans to commit 5% of its shares to a new Anthropic Public Benefit Fund, pending stockholder approval.\n\n- **Base stake:** The company's own announcement says the 5% stake is conditional on stockholder approval. Subject to stockholder approval, 5% of Anthropic's shares will be committed today, with an additional 2% added at the board's discretion for every 50% increase in the company's value above a set baseline.\n- **Growth mechanism:** The board can add 2 percentage points for each 50% rise in valuation over a baseline that has not been disclosed (the company said). Anthropic hasn't said how high the fund's share could eventually climb.\n- **Total dedicated equity:** Combined with the new commitment, roughly 20% of Anthropic's shares will be dedicated to the public good, counting founder and employee pledges. Those earlier pledges include co-founders pledging to donate 80% of their equity holdings.\n- **Structure:** The fund will be established as a wholly owned limited liability company rather than a 501(c)(3) tax-exempt nonprofit. Its shares cannot be used for lobbying or political contributions.\n- **Gaps:** Coverage notes that Anthropic publishes no valuation, no baseline for the 50% steps, no trustees and no recipients.\n- **Timing:** One report says the approval step would come after the company's hotly anticipated IPO which could occur as soon as November.\n- **Dollar value:** One outlet estimates the 5% at roughly $48 billion based on Anthropic's May valuation, though Anthropic itself gave no dollar figure."], "durationSeconds": 6.388581250000001, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_018KNibevTbcrgHjYeHjrzAN", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgDZ6mTwqUhVzMdoFV5u4", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**答案：5%。** 前提是股东批准。\n\nAnthropic 在 2026 年 10 月 18 日宣布，股东批准后，先把 5% 的公司股份放进新的 Anthropic Public Benefit Fund（公益基金）。之后公司估值每比基准值高出 50%，董事会可以酌情再加 2%。\n\n共搜 1 次。\n\n依据的网址：\n- [Anthropic 官方公告：Investing in the public benefit](https://www.anthropic.com/news/public-benefit-fund)\n- [CNBC（2026-10-18）](https://www.cnbc.com/2026/10/18/anthropic-ai-public-benefit-fund.html)\n- [Mixed News](https://mixed-news.com/en/anthropic-public-benefit-fund-5-percent-equity-stockholder-approval/)"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1563, "cache_read_input_tokens": 4321, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1563}, "output_tokens": 285, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T13:18:01.042Z", "request_id": "req_011CgDZ6mBpb6jwk9AuyyaSi"}
